// Arimo Regular + Bold (v1.341), embedded in every PDF report.
//
// Why: the jsPDF standard fonts (Helvetica) are NOT embedded in the file, so
// each PDF viewer substitutes its own font. Foxit Reader's substitute has
// different metrics, which jumbled letter sizes and spacing in our reports.
// Arimo is metric-compatible with Helvetica/Arial (identical advance widths),
// so embedding it changes nothing in the layout but renders identically in
// every viewer.
//
// Subset with fonttools (pyftsubset) to Latin, Latin-1, Greek, general
// punctuation, super/subscripts and the math symbols the reports use
// (≥ ≤ ± × √ ≈ ≠ − ∞), ~34 KB per weight.
// License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see ./OFL.txt.
export const ARIMO_REGULAR = ''
export const ARIMO_BOLD = ''
